# Project-level default arguments for every Maven invocation in this
# project. Maven reads this file automatically (since 3.3.1) and prepends
# the values here to whatever was passed on the command line.
#
# Each line is one argument. Comments (lines starting with #) and blank
# lines are ignored.
#
# We use it to point Maven at the project-local settings.xml, which
# bypasses the global Nexus mirror and routes dependency downloads
# directly to Maven Central. See settings.xml in the project root for
# the why.
#
# Effect: ./mvnw <anything> behaves as if you'd typed
#         ./mvnw -s settings.xml <anything>

-s
settings.xml
